    {
      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Atlas maxNumActiveUserIndexBuilds defaults are 1 for M10–M40, 2 for M50–M60, and 3 for M80 and above including NVMe variants; corresponding low-CPU R tiers use the same defaults. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)",
